<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines' 8-mth budget surplus 7.27 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippines' 8-mth budget surplus 7.27 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines posted a budget surplus of 7.274 billion pesos in the first eight months of the year, slightly lower than the year-ago level of 7.503 billion pesos, the Bureau of Treasury said on Monday.</p>
<p>However, the level was higher than the 972 million peso deficit the government had earlier forecast for the January to August period.</p>
</text>
